{"id":"f81f07fd843f6f94","group":"58","path":"58/batch03/58-df-zfc-measure7-linfty-seminorm.md","title":"ZFC Measure7 Linfty Seminorm","display":"df-zfc-measure7-linfty-seminorm — ZFC Measure7 Linfty Seminorm","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-measure7-linfty-seminorm","aliases":["58-df-zfc-measure7-linfty-seminorm"],"display":"df-zfc-measure7-linfty-seminorm — ZFC Measure7 Linfty Seminorm","depends_on":["[[58-df-measurable-function]]","[[58-df-measure-space]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-measure7-linfty-seminorm"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-measure7-linfty-seminorm</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-measure7-linfty-seminorm — ZFC Measure7 Linfty Seminorm"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"bbbec05fde1d3b01\" href=\"?note=bbbec05fde1d3b01\" title=\"58-df-measurable-function\">58-df-measurable-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"83a15c7e9b3817dc\" href=\"?note=83a15c7e9b3817dc\" title=\"58-df-measure-space\">58-df-measure-space</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,\\mathcal A,\\mu,f\\in V\">\\(X,\\mathcal A,\\mu,f\\in V\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\\in[0,\\infty]\">\\(r\\in[0,\\infty]\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S:V^3\\to\\mathsf{Bool}\">\\(\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S:V^3\\to\\mathsf{Bool}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure3RealMeasurableFunction}_S:V^3\\to\\mathsf{Bool}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure3RealMeasurableFunction}_S:V^3\\to\\mathsf{Bool}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure7LinftySeminorm}_S:V^5\\to\\mathsf{Bool}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure7LinftySeminorm}_S:V^5\\to\\mathsf{Bool}\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure7\\text{-}linfty\\text{-}seminorm}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure7LinftySeminorm}_S(X,\\mathcal A,\\mu,f,r)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\nr\\in[0,\\infty]\n\\land\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S(X,\\mathcal A,\\mu)\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure3RealMeasurableFunction}_S(X,\\mathcal A,f)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall s\\in[0,\\infty)\\;\\Bigl(\nr\\leq s\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mu\\bigl(\\{x\\in X:f(x)&gt;s\\lor f(x)&lt;-s\\}\\bigr)=0\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure7\\text{-}linfty\\text{-}seminorm}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure7LinftySeminorm}_S(X,\\mathcal A,\\mu,f,r)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\nr\\in[0,\\infty]\n\\land\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S(X,\\mathcal A,\\mu)\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure3RealMeasurableFunction}_S(X,\\mathcal A,f)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall s\\in[0,\\infty)\\;\\Bigl(\nr\\leq s\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mu\\bigl(\\{x\\in X:f(x)&gt;s\\lor f(x)&lt;-s\\}\\bigr)=0\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The extended-real value is determined by its cut of finite essential upper bounds.  This covers the value <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"+\\infty\">\\(+\\infty\\)</span> without an undeclared convention for the infimum of an empty set.</li>\n<li>The exceedance set is written as <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f(x)&gt;s\\lor f(x)&lt;-s\">\\(f(x)&gt;s\\lor f(x)&lt;-s\\)</span>, so no unregistered absolute-value operation is smuggled into the definition.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-measurable-function","status":"resolved","id":"bbbec05fde1d3b01","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-measurable-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-measure-space","status":"resolved","id":"83a15c7e9b3817dc","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-measure-space]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X,\\mathcal A,\\mu,f\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"r\\in[0,\\infty]","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S:V^3\\to\\mathsf{Bool}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure3RealMeasurableFunction}_S:V^3\\to\\mathsf{Bool}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure7LinftySeminorm}_S:V^5\\to\\mathsf{Bool}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure7\\text{-}linfty\\text{-}seminorm}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure7LinftySeminorm}_S(X,\\mathcal A,\\mu,f,r)\\\\\n&\\quad\\leftrightarrow\nr\\in[0,\\infty]\n\\land\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S(X,\\mathcal A,\\mu)\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure3RealMeasurableFunction}_S(X,\\mathcal A,f)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\\forall s\\in[0,\\infty)\\;\\Bigl(\nr\\leq s\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mu\\bigl(\\{x\\in X:f(x)>s\\lor f(x)<-s\\}\\bigr)=0\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"+\\infty","display":false},{"tex":"f(x)>s\\lor f(x)<-s","display":false}],"bytes":1436,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2635","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-zfc-measure7-linfty-seminorm.md|58-df-zfc-measure7-linfty-seminorm]]（batch03）"}],"outgoing":["bbbec05fde1d3b01","83a15c7e9b3817dc"]}